<title>USA: Seagate board approves stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Seagate board approves stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagate Technology Inc said Tuesday its board of directors approved the repurchase of an additional $600 million shares of common stock. It said the repurchases would be made from time to time depending on market conditions, share price and other factors.</p>
<p>The buyback would be on top of nearly $570 million in common share repurchases Seagate has made so far in the current fiscal year. The company has about 245 million common shares outstanding.</p>
